# {name}.circuit: sends fuel and speed to another computer down one link. Put "two computers receive" on the other.
rate 0.1
comment at=-10,-60 size=700,50 text="Link this computer to the other one; in the window that pops up, pair the channel link on both."
node 1 ship value=fuel
node 2 ship value=speed
node 3 bundle channel=link fields="fuel, speed"
wire 1.fuel 3.fuel
wire 2.speed 3.speed
